1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,800
Skip Badaling's crowds — hike 7 km of wild Great Wall instead.
I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:02,800 --> 00:00:05,200
Badaling is the famous one: a subway ride, and packed.

3
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,600
Two hours north, the wall at Jiankou is unrestored.

4
00:00:07,600 --> 00:00:10,000
Crumbling towers, broken steps, half-swallowed by forest.

5
00:00:10,000 --> 00:00:12,400
You hike roughly 7 km of ruined wall to Mutianyu.

6
00:00:12,400 --> 00:00:14,800
About three hours on the wall, plus an hour climbing up.

7
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:17,300
Double-tap if you'd take the wild wall over handrails.

8
00:00:17,300 --> 00:00:19,800
At Mutianyu you can ride a toboggan back down.

9
00:00:19,800 --> 00:00:23,000
★ Expert Tip: hire a local guide — Jiankou is unmarked and genuinely steep.

10
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:26,000
Cable car with the crowds, or 3 hours on the wild wall?
